[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0202","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0202.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1941","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 的 nsHTMLReflowState::CalculateHypotheticalBox 函数中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。当用户调整包含嵌套列中绝对定位和相对定位元素的窗口大小时，远程攻击者可利用该漏洞触发堆缓冲区溢出，导致浏览器崩溃或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Firefox 4.x 至 12.0、Firefox ESR 10.x 至 10.0.5 之前版本、Thunderbird 5.0 至 12.0、Thunderbird ESR 10.x 至 10.0.5 之前版本以及 SeaMonkey 2.10 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。攻击者需诱导用户访问特制网页并执行窗口缩放操作方可利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1941"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-05T23:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:36Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 13.0 及以上版本（ESR 分支升级至 10.0.5 及以上），Thunderbird 升级至 13.0 及以上版本（ESR 分支升级至 10.0.5 及以上），SeaMonkey 升级至 2.10 及以上版本。无法立即升级时，可在浏览器中禁用 JavaScript（about:config 设置 javascript.enabled=false）并避免访问不可信网站作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00012.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00015.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0710.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0715.html","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:088","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-40.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=750066","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16985","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1941.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1941","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1941","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-1941","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/da5ad7125749ac49ac2c49c4f3cd740b81c2c723/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-1941","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-1941.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-1941.json","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2012-1941","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-1941","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/2cfcf35c78e88db2a4354058a5c063daa41106c3/tracker/CVE/2012/CVE-2012-1941.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0202.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0202.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0201","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0201.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1940","title":"Mozilla Firefox 释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 的 nsFrameList::FirstChild 函数中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的网页，在列布局中改变绝对定位元素容器的大小，触发已释放内存的访问，导致堆内存损坏和应用程序崩溃，成功利用可实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Firefox 4.x 至 12.0、Firefox ESR 10.0.5 之前版本、Thunderbird 5.0 至 12.0、Thunderbird ESR 10.0.5 之前版本及 SeaMonkey 2.10 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。Mozilla 已在 Firefox 13 及相应 ESR 更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1940"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-05T23:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Firefox 至 13.0 及以上版本，或 Firefox ESR 升级至 10.0.5 及以上版本；Thunderbird 升级至 13.0 及以上版本，Thunderbird ESR 升级至 10.0.5 及以上版本；SeaMonkey 升级至 2.10 及以上版本。无法立即升级时，可禁用 JavaScript 或使用 NoScript 扩展作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00012.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/op