/AVE-2012-0201.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0199","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0199.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1939","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox ESR 10.x 及 Thunderbird ESR 10.x 版本的 jsinfer.cpp 组件中存在类型推断缺陷，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 JavaScript 代码触发内存破坏，导致拒绝服务或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Firefox 10.0.5 之前版本及 Thunderbird 10.0.5 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。攻击者只需诱导用户访问恶意网页即可触发，无需其他认证条件。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1939"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-05T23:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Mozilla Firefox 至 13.0 或 Firefox ESR 10.0.5 及以上版本，Thunderbird 升级至 13.0 或 Thunderbird ESR 10.0.5 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.10 及以上版本。Red Hat 用户可安装 RHSA-2012:0710/RHSA-2012:0715 更新，Debian 用户安装 DSA-2499 更新。如无法立即升级，可在 Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 中禁用 JavaScript（编辑 about:config 将 javascript.enabled 设为 false）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00012.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0710.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0715.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2499","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:088","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-34.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=748613","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1939.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1939","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-1939.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1939","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-1939","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/da5ad7125749ac49ac2c49c4f3cd740b81c2c723/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-1939","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-1939.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2012/CVE-2012-1939.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2012-1939.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-1939"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0199.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0199.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0197","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0197.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1938","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 浏览器引擎内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox、Thunderbird 及 SeaMonkey 的浏览器引擎中存在多处未指定的内存破坏漏洞，涉及 methodjit/ImmutableSync.cpp 及 JSObject::makeDenseArraySlow 函数等多个组件。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制网页触发内存损坏，导致浏览器崩溃或拒绝服务，在特定条件下可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Firefox 13.0 之前版本、Thunderbird 13.0 之前版本及 SeaMonkey 2.10 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1938"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-05T23:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:36Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 13.0 及以上版本、Thunderbird 至 13.0 及以上版本、SeaMonkey 至 2.10 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 JavaScript（设置 → 内容 → 启用 JavaScript 取消勾选）作为临时缓解措施，但会严重影响正常功能，建议优先完成版本升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00012.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00015.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0710.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0715.html","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:088","http://www.mozilla.org/sec