adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0197.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0197.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0196","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0196.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1937","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 浏览器引擎内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 浏览器引擎中存在多处未指定的内存破坏漏洞。当处理畸形网页内容时，浏览器引擎未能正确管理内存操作，导致内存损坏。远程攻击者可诱导用户访问特制的恶意网页，触发内存破坏，导致应用程序崩溃或实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Firefox 4.x 至 12.0、Firefox ESR 10.0 至 10.0.4、Thunderbird 5.0 至 12.0、Thunderbird ESR 10.0 至 10.0.4 及 SeaMonkey 2.10 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。Mozilla 已在 Firefox 13.0、Firefox ESR 10.0.5、Thunderbird 13.0、Thunderbird ESR 10.0.5 及 SeaMonkey 2.10 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1937"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-05T23:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:36Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 13.0 及以上版本、Firefox ESR 至 10.0.5 及以上版本、Thunderbird 至 13.0 及以上版本、Thunderbird ESR 至 10.0.5 及以上版本、SeaMonkey 至 2.10 及以上版本。无法立即升级时，建议禁用 JavaScript 并限制浏览器访问不可信网站以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00012.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00015.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0710.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0715.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2488","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2489","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2499","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:088","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-34.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=643967","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=723465","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=745254","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=745494","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=745580","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/sea