lished":"2012-06-05T23:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:16Z","remediation":"升级 Mozilla NSS 至 3.13.4 或更高版本。对应产品：Firefox 升级至 13.0 及以上、Firefox ESR 升级至 10.0.5 及以上、Thunderbird 升级至 13.0 及以上、Thunderbird ESR 升级至 10.0.5 及以上、SeaMonkey 升级至 2.10 及以上。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界部署 IPS/IDS 规则拦截包含异常 ASN.1 零长度字段的 OCSP 响应和证书，以降低被攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00012.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00015.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49976","http://secunia.com/advisories/50316","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2490","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:088","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-39.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/ovmbulletinjul2016-3090546.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53798","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1540-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1540-2","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=715073","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16701","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2012/CVE-2012-0441.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0441.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-0441.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-0441.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0441","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-0441","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-0441","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-0441.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-0441","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0441.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0030.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0184","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0184.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1173","title":"LibTIFF TIFF图像处理整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"LibTIFF 3.9.4 的 tiff_getimage.c 中存在多处整数溢出漏洞，当处理特制 TIFF 文件中精心构造的 tile 大小时，gtTileSeparate 和 gtStripSeparate 函数未能正确校验，导致堆缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可诱使用户打开恶意 TIFF 文件触发该漏洞，实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响广泛使用 LibTIFF 库的应用和系统，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1173"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-04T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:39:11Z","remediation":"升级 libtiff 库至 3.9.6 及以上版本（或 4.0.1 及以上版本）。Debian/Ubuntu 用户执行 apt-get update && apt-get install libtiff5；Red Hat/CentOS 用户执行 yum update libtiff；也可从官方 Git 仓库（gitlab.com/libtiff/libtiff）拉取最新源码编译安装。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对上传的 TIFF 文件进行校验，限制 tile size 字段不超过合理阈值，并禁用 libtiff 对畸形 TIFF 文件的自动解析。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugzilla.maptools.org/attachment.cgi?id=477&action=diff","http://bugzilla.maptools.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2369","http://home.gdal.org/private/zdi-can-1221/zdi-can-1221.txt","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00004.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2012-April/077463.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2012-April/078403.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2012-April/078835.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0468.html","http://secunia.com/advisorie