e,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0184.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0144","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0144.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0671","title":"Apple QuickTime .pict 文件内存破坏漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 7.7.1 及之前版本在处理 .pict 文件时存在内存破坏漏洞。攻击者可构造特制的 .pict 文件并诱使用户通过 QuickTime 打开，触发内存损坏，导致远程代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 Windows 和 macOS 平台上的 QuickTime 播放器，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。用户需升级至 QuickTime 7.7.2 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0671"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-05-16T10:12:58Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:02Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apple QuickTime 至 7.7.2 或更高版本。Apple 已停止对 QuickTime for Windows 提供安全更新，建议 Windows 用户卸载 QuickTime 并改用其他媒体播放器（如 VLC）。macOS 用户应确保系统已安装最新安全更新。如无法升级，避免在浏览器中打开不可信的 .pict 文件，并禁用 QuickTime 浏览器插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00005.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00004.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5261","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5501","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53584","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027065","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15219","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0671.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0671","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0671.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0671.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0671.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0671.json