.7.2 之前版本，攻击复杂度中等，无需身份认证，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0668"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-05-16T10:12:57Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:02Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apple QuickTime 至 7.7.2 或更高版本（该版本修复了此缓冲区溢出漏洞）。对于 Windows 系统，Apple 已于 2016 年停止支持 QuickTime，建议彻底卸载 QuickTime 并改用其他媒体播放器（如 VLC），同时移除浏览器中的 QuickTime 插件以防止通过网页触发的远程利用。如必须保留使用，应禁用浏览器 QuickTime 插件并将受信任站点列表限制到最小范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00005.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00004.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5261","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5501","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53579","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027065","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15821","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2012/CVE-2012-0668.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0668.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0668","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-0668.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0668.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2012/CVE-2012-0668.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0668.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0668.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0668.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2adf3d659b2229087465cbedc